---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Dumpsters 911"
  description="Read the Privacy Policy for Dumpsters 911. Learn how we collect, protect, and handle your personal information when requesting dumpster quotes or booking online."
  canonical="https://dumpsters911.com/privacy-policy/"
  activePage="privacy"
>
  <section class="hero-section" style="padding: 50px 0 35px; text-align: center;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <span class="banner-pill" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Legal & Transparency</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title" style="font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.2;">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 10px;">
        Last Updated: January 1, 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 60px 0 90px; background-color: var(--bg-cream);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 3px solid #000000; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #000000; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px 35px; color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1rem;">
        
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          1. Introduction
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          Dumpsters 911 ("we," "our," or "us"), a registered trade name of Dumpsters 2 Go LLC, is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website at <strong>dumpsters911.com</strong>, request a dumpster rental quote, or book services online in Metro Detroit, Michigan.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          2. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
          We collect information that you voluntarily provide to us when interacting with our website or services, including:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px; color: #475569;">
          <li><strong>Personal Contact Information:</strong> Name, phone number, email address, and service delivery address when completing quote forms or booking online.</li>
          <li><strong>Rental Details:</strong> Desired dumpster size, delivery timeline, drop-off location instructions, and project debris type.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical & Usage Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, referring URL, pages visited, and interaction data via cookies and analytics tools (including Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          3. How We Use Your Information
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
          We use the information collected for legitimate business purposes, including:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px; color: #475569;">
          <li>Fulfilling dumpster rental requests, scheduling deliveries, and processing online bookings.</li>
          <li>Communicating order status, delivery notifications, and receipt confirmations via phone, SMS, or email.</li>
          <li>Providing responsive customer service and answering inquiries.</li>
          <li>Improving site performance, optimizing conversion flows, and analyzing ad performance.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          4. SMS & Mobile Phone Communications Policy
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          By providing your phone number on our website forms, you consent to receive order-related telephone calls and text messages (SMS) regarding your dumpster rental. <strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> All text messaging opt-in data and consent will not be transferred to any third party.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          5. Information Sharing & Third Parties
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We may share information only with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website, conducting our business, or servicing you (such as payment gateways, CRM infrastructure, and web analytics), provided those parties agree to keep this information confidential.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          6. Cookies & Tracking Technologies
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          Our site uses cookies, pixel tags, and local storage to personalize your browsing experience, carry over promotional discount parameters, and measure advertising conversion metrics (such as Google Ads & Bing Ads). You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or notify you when a cookie is being sent.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          7. Data Security
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          We implement industry-standard administrative, technical, and physical security measures to safeguard your personal data. All online booking transactions are processed over encrypted SSL (HTTPS) connections.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          8. Contact Us
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
          If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or wish to update or delete your personal data, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 2px solid #000000; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; font-weight: 600;">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;"><strong>Dumpsters 911</strong></p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">Phone: <a href="tel:248-479-3667" style="color: var(--primary-red); font-weight: 800;">(248) 479-3667</a></p>
          <p style="margin: 0;">Service Area: Metro Detroit & Surrounding Michigan Counties</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
